# Stitch-first Event & Tournament Design

Before inventing new event or tournament UI in code, follow `.cursor/skills/stitch-event-factory/SKILL.md`.

1. Collect real facts: organizer, venue, city, start/end, sport, price, capacity, sponsors, promo copy.
2. Call **Google Stitch MCP** (`stitch` / `user-stitch`) to generate a design proposal from those facts.
3. Only then port into Next.js with existing Apex Elite Tailwind tokens.

If Stitch MCP is disconnected, tell the user to enable it in Cursor Settings → MCP — do not skip to a freehand redesign.
